{"id":"461105e1-34cb-4dd3-9157-6e7b875f725e","rule_id":"745b0119-0560-43ba-860a-7235dd8cee8d","name":"【默认】双端用户异常时段登录（机器学习）","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":208,"revision":6,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:08:51.840Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T02:32:15.422Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"15m","from":"now-30m","to":"now","description":"机器学习：检测用户在罕见时段的成功登录。依赖 Job auth_rare_hour_for_a_user_ea，过滤条件为 event.category:authentication 且登录成功，索引含 logs-* / winlogbeat-* 等，Linux 与 Windows 认证日志均可，不限 Windows。对应需求：异常账号登录时间。","tags":["操作系统: 双端","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","规则类型: 机器学习","对应需求: 异常登录时间"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["host.name","user.name","source.ip","process.name","agent.id","kibana.alert.rule.name","kibana.alert.severity"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":">=9.0.0"},{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"}],"required_fields":[],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n需要 Windows/域控安全日志（Winlogbeat 或 Agent Windows 集成）。部分规则依赖活动目录相关事件。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n请结合 Windows 安全事件字段：`user.name`、`source.ip`、`host.name`、`event.code`、`winlog.event_data.*`。\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权。\n2. 无授权则遏制账号并溯源。\n3. 关联同用户的登录失败、组变更、GPO 变更。\n","false_positives":["变更窗口内的合法管理操作","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"references":["https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/security/current/prebuilt-ml-jobs.html"],"risk_score":21,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"low","severity_mapping":[],"output_index":"","max_